        "TileImage": "$($repository 9af0780c-29a8-47a3-9d36-669ab2028113).Image",
        "Description": "5 undercover FBI agents have been identified on the SCEPTRE. Their task is to find and neutralize The Apex Predator aka Agent 47.  They are roaming around the building and hiding in plain sight. Their faces and identities have been revealed to 47 for a limited time, and this is the only chance to eliminate.\rYour mission: Find and neutralize the thread, at all costs. Use everything you need to get rid of this agents.\rYou will be highly rewarded.\rGood luck, 47.",
